diag(min5): persistent progress blocks in C

sweet_early_block(slot, argb) draws a 36x21 block at x=1300, y=88+32*slot (right of the widest text line, so the stage text cannot overwrite it) after each stage mark in arm_init: slots 0-9 = stages 1,2,3,4,5,6,6a,6b,6c,7. Same alias and a5_active gating as the text; no logic change.

